{"ref":"BDB, רוּם²","hw":"רוּם²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רוּם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֻם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>height, haughtiness (</strong>proposes inf.<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>,<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>height, loftiness</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמַיִם לָר׳ וָאָרֶץ לָעֹמֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.3\">Pr 25:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּם עֵינַיִם</span> fig. of <em>haughtiness</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.12\">Is 10:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּדֶל לֵבָב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.4\">Pr 21:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחַב־לֵב</span>); so <span dir=\"rtl\">רֻם לִבּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.29\">Je 48:29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּאוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּבַתּ</span>); then alone:<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>haughtiness</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּם אֲנָשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.11\">Is 2:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.17\">17</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּבְהוּת</span>).","next":"BDB, רוֹם","prev":"BDB, רוּם"}